-- 136: NIGHT WINDOW — piano removed; only bass + main D synth loop for isolation.
-- Sources (all SC boot aliases): p80a/p80b Dmaj + p80c Amaj one-bar LPViz
-- synth loops, p70perc & p85drumA percussion loops, humanip vxA/B/D vocal
-- fragments, 808/p70 kit, dubsub, sweetChords. No web sample needed.
-- 3/5/7/11/13-bar gain masks on independent DJ decks; 3*5*7*11*13 =
-- 15015 bars before all mask phases coincide. The transformations have
-- other coprime periods; the kick/clap remains stable as a dance anchor.
-- Vocal is chopped into vowels/feelings, not understandable words.
-- Harmony: Tune Pile chords/progressions.txt vi-IV-I-V [a] (F#m/D/A/E),
-- recast as two 4-bar passes of inversions/extensions on superpiano.
-- Mix recall: after SC boot, execute sc/house132-master.scd in sclang.
-- The scene itself does not send m* params (that bridge is inert); the SC
-- preset supplies fixed makeup + gentle compression + limiter ceiling.
setcps (118/240)

d1 $ silence

d2 $ silence

d3 $ silence

d4 $ silence

d5 $ n "<[fs2 ~ ~ cs2 ~ fs2 e2 ~] [d2 ~ ~ a1 ~ d2 cs2 ~] [a1 ~ ~ e2 ~ a1 gs1 ~] [e2 ~ ~ b1 ~ e2 cs2 ~]>" # s "dubsub" # amp 0.38 # drive 0.18 # pitchEnv 0.12 # gain 0.42 # hpf 32 # lpf 2700 # pan 0.5 # ddSend 0 # verbSend 0.03

d6 $ every 11 (rev) $ loopAt 1 $ s "p80a" # gain "<0.48 0.38 0>" # hpf 220 # lpf (slow 17 $ range 2600 6200 sine) # pan 0.36 # cut 6 # ddSend 0.05 # verbSend 0.1

d7 $ silence

d8 $ silence

d9 $ silence

d10 $ silence

d11 $ silence

d12 $ silence
